    <briefdescription>
<para>Do not allow two particles to be in the same state. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If a <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1ParticleStatesTable" kindref="compound">ParticleStatesTable</ref> is passed, then two particles must be in the same state if they have the same <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1ParticleStates" kindref="compound">ParticleStates</ref>, otherwise, if a ParticlePairs is passed then pairs found in the list must have the same state index. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
